    <string name="app_description">Ithuluzi eliphelele lokufakwa kwephaneli yelanga nokulungiselelwa. Inikwa amandla idatha yesathelayithi enembe kakhulu ye-PVGIS, lolu hlelo lokusebenza luhlinzeka ngokuhlaziywa kwemisebe yelanga eqondene nendawo kanye nezilinganiso zokukhiqiza amandla. Izici zihlanganisa i-tiltmeter enembe, izincomo ze-engeli elungile ezisekelwe ezithombeni zesathelayithi kanye nezibikezelo ezinemininingwane zanyanga zonke zokuphuma ukuze kukhuliswe ukusebenza kahle kwesistimu yakho.</string>
