    <string name="tiltmeter_usage_instructions">1. Khetha imodi: Khetha ukuthuthukiswa okumisiwe, kwansuku zonke, noma kwezinsuku ezingu-30.\n2. Beka ifoni: Beka idivayisi isicaba kuphaneli yelanga, isikrini sibheke phezulu.\n3. Qondanisa: Jikisa iphaneli ngokuvundlile kuze kube yilapho umcibisholo wekhampasi ukhomba uqondiswe kuye.\n4. Lungisa ukutsheka: Tshekisa iphaneli iye phezulu noma phansi kuze kube yilapho ibhamuza liba phakathi nendawo futhi lihambisana nokuqondiswe kuye.\n5. Kwenziwe: Isikrini siphenduka sibe luhlaza uma ukuqondisa kunembe (&amp;lt; 5°).</string>
