    <string name="satellite_tiltmeter_instructions">1. Idatha Ezenzakalelayo: Uhlelo lokusebenza lulanda i-engeli yesathelayithi efanelekile (SARAH3) yendawo yakho.\n2. Ukuqinisekisa Ngesandla (uyazikhethela): Chofoza isixhumanisi ngezansi. Kusizindalwazi: khetha \"PVGIS-SARAH3\", maka u-\"Optimize slope\" bese ucindezela u-buka imiphumela.\n3. Beka ifoni: Beka idivayisi isicaba kuphaneli yelanga.\n4. Lungisa iphaneli: Jikisa ukuze uqondanise ikhampasi bese utshekisa phezulu/phansi ukuze uqondanise ne-engeli oqondiswe kuyo.\n5. Kwenziwe: Isikrini siphenduka sibe luhlaza uma ukuqondisa kunembe (&amp;lt; 5°).</string>
